        :rulingText """Damage that is prevented never occurs, so any triggered abilities that trigger due to combat damage that would have been dealt by Weeping Angel won't trigger."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2023-10-13"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """As the first triggered ability of Weeping Angel resolves, it continues to be an artifact but will stop being both an Alien and an Angel until it becomes a creature again. It's just a statue, how dangerous could it be?"""@en ] .

