    :oracleText """Creatures can't attack you unless their controller pays {2} for each creature they control that's attacking you."""@en ;
    :flavorText """"It's subtler than that. Any stronger and people would question it. But contained in that rhythm, in layers of code, Vote Saxon. Believe in me. Whispering to the world."
—The Tenth Doctor"""@en ;
